msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,VoxNamingSettings:UnrealEngineNames"
msgid "Patterns used with the Unreal Engine naming convention (prefixes such as SM_, MI_, T_). Tokens: {BaseName}, {ModelId}, {Color}, {Description}; underscores inside the braces are only written when the token has a value."
